<title>FINLAND: POSTIPANKKI TO ISSUE TWO FIM 200 MLN BONDS.</title>
<headline>POSTIPANKKI TO ISSUE TWO FIM 200 MLN BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned banking group Postipankki Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it will issue two 200 million markka bonds on Novemeber 28.</p>
<p>A three-year bond will have a floating issue price and a 3.5 percent coupon, it said.</p>
<p>A six-year bond will have a floating issue price as well, and a 4.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>The subscription period will run from November 28 to February 7, Postipankki said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
